load-test/
# k6 measurement harness — the k6 binary is external by design (roadmap A5:
# "أداة خارج المستودع"), and the harness must never enter the layered
# runtime image (same exclusion logic as docs/).
# Documentation trees — never needed in the build context (the layered runtime
# image only ships application code + libs; excluding them shrinks the context
# sent to the builder — Dockerfile best practices: "exclude files that are not
# needed for the build" / "prevent copying them to the image").
docs/
keys/
# Signing keys must never enter the build context (repo carries the runbook only
# today; this also future-proofs a dev keystore dropped into keys/).
.ci/
.github/
